      "content_md": "![Image](http://www.holography.ru/images/forums/den1.jpg)\n\nDear colleagues,\n\nWe've been recently informed about sad news for our community:\n\nYuri Denisyuk, famous scientist and holography pioneer is dead at 88.\n\nFuneral ceremony will be held tomorrow in St.-Petersburg, Russia.\n\nYou can find out details and send your condolences to the addresses: [nina@holo.ioffe.ru](mailto:nina@holo.ioffe.ru), [v.konstantinov@mail.ioffe.ru](mailto:v.konstantinov@mail.ioffe.ru)",
